      "writtenOn": "2021-02-04T19:01:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At times the property `system_shared_libs` is set in a property for a specific config (e.g. arch or static/shared), since we are not creating any variants in bazel conversion mode, SystemSharedLibs can inaccurately appear nil and add libraries here that result in a cyclic dependency. Added a comment to this extent.\n\nWe\u0027ll likely need to update the logic in the cc* deps mutators for the cc* conversion.",
      "parentUuid": "ebb984b1_c23c8815",
      "range": {
